1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,888
Does your skin look tired and dull by the end of the day?

2
00:00:03,888 --> 00:00:08,977
In this review, we look at the Dermalogica BioLumin-C Night Restore Serum: what it

3
00:00:08,977 --> 00:00:11,211
is, what's in it, and how to use it.

4
00:00:11,973 --> 00:00:16,386
It's an overnight serum with ultra-stable vitamin C and pro-vitamin D.

5
00:00:16,386 --> 00:00:20,799
It works while you sleep, to help repair your skin's moisture barrier.

6
00:00:20,799 --> 00:00:24,645
That's why you use it at night, as the last serum before bed.

7
00:00:25,345 --> 00:00:27,212
Vitamin C is the star here.

8
00:00:27,212 --> 00:00:32,742
In the ingredient list it appears as aminopropyl ascorbyl phosphate, a vitamin C

9
00:00:32,742 --> 00:00:33,502
derivative.

10
00:00:33,502 --> 00:00:37,927
The serum gives long-lasting brightness and immediate hydration.

11
00:00:38,696 --> 00:00:41,432
Pro-vitamin D is the other half of the name.

12
00:00:41,432 --> 00:00:46,345
Together, the formula helps repair and restore the skin's moisture barrier, and

13
00:00:46,345 --> 00:00:48,149
helps reverse daytime damage.

14
00:00:48,911 --> 00:00:54,692
The ingredient list also includes tranexamic acid, ergothioneine, glycerin, jojoba

15
00:00:54,692 --> 00:00:56,948
esters, squalane and tocopherol.

16
00:00:57,718 --> 00:00:58,643
Who is it for?

17
00:00:58,643 --> 00:01:03,993
Skin with dehydration, hyperpigmentation, lackluster skin, and a damaged moisture

18
00:01:03,993 --> 00:01:04,521
barrier.

19
00:01:05,287 --> 00:01:10,428
The texture is a rich, silky serum that absorbs quickly and is generally non-sticky.

20
00:01:11,128 --> 00:01:12,310
So, a quick recap.

21
00:01:12,310 --> 00:01:16,579
It's a night serum with ultra-stable vitamin C and pro-vitamin D.

22
00:01:16,579 --> 00:01:21,964
It gives long-lasting brightness and immediate hydration, helps repair and restore

23
00:01:21,964 --> 00:01:26,955
the moisture barrier, and helps reverse daytime damage, all while you sleep.

24
00:01:27,721 --> 00:01:28,924
Here's how to use it.

25
00:01:28,924 --> 00:01:30,814
At night, cleanse and tone first.

26
00:01:31,514 --> 00:01:36,247
Then dispense three to four drops, and apply evenly over your face and neck before

27
00:01:36,247 --> 00:01:36,477
bed.

28
00:01:36,477 --> 00:01:37,920
Keep it out of your eyes.

29
00:01:38,678 --> 00:01:43,201
Layering is simple: apply it after your toner, and before your moisturizer.

30
00:01:43,901 --> 00:01:46,083
People with sensitive skin can use it.

31
00:01:46,083 --> 00:01:50,216
If you know you're sensitive to a specific ingredient, patch test first.

32
00:01:50,916 --> 00:01:55,871
It has no artificial fragrances, though the botanicals may have a natural scent.

33
00:01:55,871 --> 00:02:01,073
If you want brightness, hydration and barrier repair in one night-time step, this is

34
00:02:01,073 --> 00:02:02,374
the serum to look at.

35
00:02:02,374 --> 00:02:04,294
The link is in the description.
